{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "S3: a permutation group of degree 3, order 6\n  generators: (1 2 3), (1 2)\n  base: 1, 2; basic orbit lengths 3 2 (the order is their product); 3 strong generators\n  orbits: {1, 2, 3} (transitive)\n  abelian: no\n  derived series (orders): 6 > 3 > 1\n  solvable: yes\n  lower central series (orders): 6 > 3\n  nilpotent: no\n  centre: order 1\n  how: Schreier-Sims (deterministic): every Schreier generator of every level sifts to the identity\n  check: every generator sifts through the stabilizer chain and its word rebuilds it: verified\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "permgroup", "ucas": "permgroup S3", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "permgroup", "order_value": "6", "solvable_value": true, "generators": "(1 2 3), (1 2)", "base": "1, 2; basic orbit lengths 3 2 (the order is their product); 3 strong generators", "orbits": "{1, 2, 3} (transitive)", "abelian": "no", "derived_series_orders": "6 > 3 > 1", "solvable": "yes", "lower_central_series_orders": "6 > 3", "nilpotent": "no", "centre": "order 1", "method": "Schreier-Sims (deterministic): every Schreier generator of every level sifts to the identity", "headline": "S3: a permutation group of degree 3, order 6"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "every generator sifts through the stabilizer chain and its word rebuilds it: verified"}], "files": [], "text": "S3: a permutation group of degree 3, order 6\n  generators: (1 2 3), (1 2)\n  base: 1, 2; basic orbit lengths 3 2 (the order is their product); 3 strong generators\n  orbits: {1, 2, 3} (transitive)\n  abelian: no\n  derived series (orders): 6 > 3 > 1\n  solvable: yes\n  lower central series (orders): 6 > 3\n  nilpotent: no\n  centre: order 1\n  how: Schreier-Sims (deterministic): every Schreier generator of every level sifts to the identity\n  check: every generator sifts through the stabilizer chain and its wo