{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 10, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  input: f1 = x^2 - 1, f2 = x^3 - 1\nreduced Groebner basis (grevlex, x, over Q): 1 element\n  g1: x - 1\n  g1 = (-x)*f1 + (1)*f2\n  pairs: 3; reduced: 2; skipped by the criteria: 1\n  how: Buchberger (normal strategy, product and chain criteria), every element carrying its cofactors\n  check: each g_i = sum c_ij f_j multiplied out; each f_j reduces to 0; every S-pair of the basis reduces to 0: verified\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 10, "ok": true, "cmd": "groebner", "ucas": "groebner x^2-1, x^3-1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "groebner", "basis": ["x - 1"], "input": "f1 = x^2 - 1, f2 = x^3 - 1", "g1": ["x - 1", "(-x)*f1 + (1)*f2"], "pairs": "3; reduced: 2; skipped by the criteria: 1", "method": "Buchberger (normal strategy, product and chain criteria), every element carrying its cofactors", "headline": "reduced Groebner basis (grevlex, x, over Q): 1 element"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "each g_i = sum c_ij f_j multiplied out; each f_j reduces to 0; every S-pair of the basis reduces to 0: verified"}], "files": [], "text": "  input: f1 = x^2 - 1, f2 = x^3 - 1\nreduced Groebner basis (grevlex, x, over Q): 1 element\n  g1: x - 1\n  g1 = (-x)*f1 + (1)*f2\n  pairs: 3; reduced: 2; skipped by the criteria: 1\n  how: Buchberger (normal strategy, product and chain criteria), every element carrying its cofactors\n  check: each g_i = sum c_ij f_j multiplied out; each f_j reduces to 0; every S-pair of the basis reduces to 0: verified\n"}, "isError": false}}
