{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 15, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I = (x, y), J = (x+y, x-y) (grevlex, x > y, over Q): I = J\n  reduced Groebner basis of I: x, y\n  reduced Groebner basis of J: x, y\n  check: each generator of the smaller ideal is a combination of the other's generators (cofactors multiplied out)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 15, "ok": true, "cmd": "idealeq", "ucas": "idealeq x, y = x+y, x-y", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "idealeq", "equal": true, "i_in_j": true, "j_in_i": true, "reduced_groebner_basis_of_i": "x, y", "reduced_groebner_basis_of_j": "x, y", "headline": "I = (x, y), J = (x+y, x-y) (grevlex, x > y, over Q): I = J"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "each generator of the smaller ideal is a combination of the other's generators (cofactors multiplied out)"}], "files": [], "text": "I = (x, y), J = (x+y, x-y) (grevlex, x > y, over Q): I = J\n  reduced Groebner basis of I: x, y\n  reduced Groebner basis of J: x, y\n  check: each generator of the smaller ideal is a combination of the other's generators (cofactors multiplied out)\n"}, "isError": false}}
